// bubbler profile: steam
// Partial: this grants what bubbler has, which is not all Steam wants.
// Missing is the system bus (UPower, and UDisks2 for Wine), which bubbler
// has no service for, along with /dev/ntsync, /dev/hugepages, /dev/fuse
// and /dev/snd. The 32-bit runtime is what `seccomp { disable }` is here
// for: the filter is generated for this architecture alone and kills a
// process that makes an i386 syscall. Steam also wants the multilib
// 32-bit GL and Vulkan drivers and an en_US.UTF-8 locale on the host, and
// a library folder outside the private home has to be named, e.g.
//   path-share "/kioxia/Steam" mode=rw
wayland
dri
pipewire
network
dbus
portals
notify
tray
gamepad
home-share ".steam" mode=rw
seccomp {
    disable
}
command "steam"
